OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised at protest over
OL,4,Atraveller site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents have accused a
OL,7,Fcouncil of "gross failure" over its
OL,8,Fresponse to the development of an
OL,9,Funauthorised traveller site in their
OL,10,Fvillage.
OL,12,FWork began on the four-acre (1.6-ha)
OL,13,Ffield in Willows Green, near Felsted,
OL,14,FEssex, in May and a retrospective
OL,15,Fplanning application for the site was
OL,16,Fsubmitted to Uttlesford District
OL,17,FCouncil on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
