OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised at protest over
OL,4,Atraveller site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 100 people from Willows Green
OL,7,Fstaged a protest outside the
OL,8,Fauthority's building on Thursday over
OL,9,Fwhy it had not been able to prevent the
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FThe council issued a temporary "stop
OL,13,Fnotice" on 6 May after the field was
OL,14,Fconcreted over and said on Thursday it
OL,15,Fwas "doing everything we can".
